The ensemble cast includes Daisy Edgar-Jones, Glen Powell, Anthony
Ramos, Brandon Perea, Maura Tierney, and Sasha Lane.

15
01:16:52,500 --> 01:16:58,500
It follows clashing groups of storm chasers who
investigate a tornado outbreak in Oklahoma.

16
01:22:00,000 --> 01:22:06,000
Talks for a sequel to Twister began in 2020, with Kosinski pitching an idea to Universal Pictures and Helen Hunt,
who starred in the original, also expressing interest in a follow-up that was ultimately rejected.

17
01:27:07,500 --> 01:27:13,500
Several directors were approached before Chung was hired in December 2022.

18
01:32:15,000 --> 01:32:21,000
The cast joined in early-2023 and filming took place around Oklahoma that
summer, with a brief hiatus due to the SAG-AFTRA strike.

19
01:37:22,500 --> 01:37:28,500
Twisters premiered at the Cineworld Leicester Square in London on July 8,
2024, and was released internationally by Warner Bros.

20
01:42:30,000 --> 01:42:36,000
Pictures on July 10 and in the United States and
Canada by Universal Pictures on July 19.

21
